
### 11.2 Application-level signals

The application writes one line per notable event to stdout/stderr with a
stable prefix (`[web]`, `[worker]`, or the route or job name in brackets).
The operator's log aggregation (journald to a collector, Loki, or similar)
groups on that prefix. There is no metrics endpoint in the repository; a
prometheus scrape target is not present, and the operator adds one by
wrapping the JSON logs.

